error[E0507]: `panic` is used in an erased position
  --> tests/cirkalang/fail/cap/forge.cirka:13:31
   |
13 |   let 0 fs : Cap FileSystem = panic "forged"
   |                               ^^^^^ erased: never computed
   = note: an erased value is never computed: `panic` there does not stop the program, and its result would prove anything
   = help: use total functions in erased values (proofs, indices), or compute the value at run time (spec-v0.0.4.md §2.4)
